// A labelled block whose exits disagree (owner ruling 2026-09-29): `break :B 1` and the tail
// `"s"` join to `i32 | string`, a boxed value union. The proof prints the string member, which
// only the tail path yields.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/matrix.py, whose docstring is the spec.
// @@PRELUDE@@
function seven(): i32 { 7 }
// @@VALUE@@
B: { if seven() > 9 { break :B 1 }; "s" }
// @@TYPE@@
i32 | string
// @@PROOF@@
print(v)
// @@WANT@@
s
// @@TEST@@
v is string
// @@HIT@@
print(v)
// @@MISS@@
print("miss")
// @@SKIP@@
argument: a call argument reads `B: {` as the named argument `B`, so a block there is parenthesized, `f((B: { … }))`, graded in `tests/cases/loops/loop-value-positions.vl`
array_push: same
map_set: same
early_return_guard: same
